  "math_index": [
    {
      "text": "> 10 Dataset Sources",
      "section_id": "sec:introduction",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "> 6k Robotic Tasks",
      "section_id": "sec:introduction",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "> 70k Human-robot Pairs",
      "section_id": "sec:introduction",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": ">45",
      "section_id": "sec:dataset",
      "page_start": 5,
      "page_end": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "flow time t ∈[0,1], the noised video and target velocity are",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "xt = (1 −t)x0 + tϵ,",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "t = ϵ −x0.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Lfm = Ex0,ϵ,t [∥vθ(xt,t,c) −v⋆",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 0.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Each robot trajectory is chunked into τ = {(xi,ai)}N",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "i=1, where xi is a video chunk and ai is the temporally",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "pθ(xi+1,ai+1 ∣x≤i,a≤i,c).",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "pθ(xi+1,ai+1 ∣x≤i,a≤i,c) = pvid",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "θ (xi+1 ∣x≤i,a≤i,c)",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "θ (ai+1 ∣x≤i,a≤i,xi+1,c),",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "trajectory prefix (x≤i,a≤i) and is supervised on the next video-action chunk. For trajectories from Task-diverse",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "VA data, the condition is the language instruction, c = ℓ. For trajectories from HumanGen data, the condition",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "is c = {h,ℓ}, where h is the same-task human video instruction and ℓis the language instruction.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Cvid,i = [[h,x≤i],a≤i,ℓ],",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "θ (xi+1 ∣Cvid,i) = pvid",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "θ (xi+1 ∣[h,x≤i],a≤i,ℓ).",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Cact,i = [x≤i,a≤i,xi+1,ℓ],",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "θ (ai+1 ∣Cact,i) = pact",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "θ (ai+1 ∣x≤i,a≤i,xi+1,ℓ).",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "posrobot(q,y,x) = (q,y,x),",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "poshuman(q,y,x) = (q,y + ∆H,x),",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "∆H > Hmv.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "chunk can often be predicted by extrapolating the recent robot history (x≤i). This creates a shortcut that",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Let s ≥1 be the temporal stride and K be the number of future chunks to predict. The k-th future target is",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "jk = (i + 1) + 1 + (k −1)s,",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "k = 1,...,K.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "k=1, where Gk is responsible for denoising the k-th",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "m=1 denote the collected feature representations of xi+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "ϕi+1 = Pfuse (Concat({ri+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "m=1)).",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "θ,k (xjk ∣ϕi+1,x≤i,a≤i,ℓ),",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "k = 1,...,K.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Lifp =",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "k=1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "wkLfm (xjk;ϕi+1,x≤i,a≤i,ℓ).",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "= (1 −t)xi+1 + tϵi+1,",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "= ϵi+1 −xi+1.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "fm (c) = ∥vvid",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": ",t ∣x≤i,a≤i,c) −v⋆,i+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "∼N(0,I) and flow time r ∈[0,1], we form",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "= (1 −r)ai+1 + rϵi+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "= ϵi+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "a (c) = ∥uact",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": ",r ∣x≤i,a≤i,xi+1,c) −u⋆,i+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "For Task-diverse VA samples, the condition is language-only, c = ℓ, and the loss is",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "LVA = Ei,t,r,ϵ,ϵa [Li+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "For HumanGen samples, the video prediction is conditioned on c = {h,ℓ} and augmented with in-context",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "LICL = Ei,t,r,ϵ,ϵa [Li+1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "In language-only mode, the model conditions on the text instruction, i.e., c = ℓ. In ICL mode, the human",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "video is encoded once and its tokens are cached as prefix memory, so the model conditions on c = {h,ℓ}, where",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 6,
      "page_end": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "The video Transformer follows the Wan-2.2 backbone with hidden dimension dv = 3072 and 30 transformer",
      "section_id": "sec:experiments",
      "page_start": 9,
      "page_end": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "layers. The action Transformer uses hidden dimension da = 3072, with parameters initialized from the video",
      "section_id": "sec:experiments",
      "page_start": 9,
      "page_end": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "positional encoding, and the height-axis RoPE offset for ICL human video is set to ∆H = 32. We use the",
      "section_id": "sec:experiments",
      "page_start": 9,
      "page_end": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "is encoded with T5 [38]. The IFP module predicts K = 4 future robot video chunks with temporal stride s = 2.",
      "section_id": "sec:experiments",
      "page_start": 9,
      "page_end": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "The corresponding future-prediction loss weights are (w1,...,w4) = (0.5,0.25,0.15,0.15).",
      "section_id": "sec:experiments",
      "page_start": 9,
      "page_end": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "[28] Qwen Team. Qwen3.6-Plus: Towards real world agents. Official blog, https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen3.6, April",
      "section_id": "sec:references",
      "page_start": 16,
      "page_end": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "Real-time vision-language-action model at 32 hz on an RTX 4090 with < 1 GB VRAM. arXiv:2607.27205, 2026.",
